@* MeetingStatusPill — the shared meeting-lifecycle status chip for the
   speaker + delegation review desks. Maps a MeetingRequestStatus to a DISTINCT
   SimfPill variant + a shared localized label so the six states read the same way on
   both desks and are visually distinguishable: Pending (awaiting your review) vs
   AwaitingConfirmation (approved, awaiting the other party) were both amber before;
   Accepted (confirmed/booked) vs Done (checked in) were both green; Rejected vs
   Cancelled were both grey. Replaces the duplicated per-page switch (DRY). *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<Strings> L

<SimfPill Variant="@Variant">@L[LabelKey]</SimfPill>
